    cml:operator "Cannot" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Prohibition on granting authorisation for disclosure of information before determination." ;
    cml:premiseText "(6B) The Commission does not have power to grant an authorisation under subsection (6A) to a corporation to make a particular disclosure of information if the disclosure occurred before the Commission makes a determination in respect of the application." ;
